    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεμάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young deer, pricket</i>, between <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝεβρός</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαφος</span>
			(so <i><span class="en">
				Ar.Byz.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				711.37
			</span></i>, cf. Miller <i>Mélanges de litt.gr.</i><i><span class="en">
				p.431
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.361
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.879
			</span></i>, Herodic. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.222a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.14
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεμμάς</span></b>  (q.v.), and in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεμφάς</span></b> , (Cf. Skt.
				<i>śáma</i>-'hornless', Lith.
				<i>šmúlas</i> 'hornless', O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>hind.</i>)</div>
